@startuml sequence-history
' Sequence Diagram History - PIXEL-T

title Sequence Diagram History - PIXEL-T

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline false
skinparam roundcorner 5

skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #DCE9F7
  BorderColor #2E5E9E
  FontColor #172B4D
}
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E5E9E
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E5E9E
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #EEF5FC
  GroupBorderColor #2E5E9E
  GroupBackgroundColor #EEF5FC
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
}

actor "Pengguna" as User
participant "Halaman History\n(React + API Client)" as History
participant "Flask API\n+ AnalysisService" as API
participant "Supabase Auth" as Auth
database "Supabase Database" as Database
participant "Supabase Storage" as Storage

User -> History: Membuka halaman History
History -> API: GET /api/history\n(access token)
API -> Auth: Verifikasi token
Auth --> API: User terautentikasi
API -> Database: Ambil maksimal 20 riwayat milik user\n(urut terbaru)
Database --> API: Daftar riwayat
loop Untuk setiap gambar asli
  API -> Storage: Buat signed URL thumbnail
  Storage --> API: URL thumbnail
end
API --> History: Daftar riwayat
alt Riwayat kosong
  History --> User: Menampilkan empty state\n& tombol New Analysis
else Riwayat tersedia
  History --> User: Menampilkan daftar

  loop Pengguna mencari atau memfilter riwayat
    User -> History: Cari nama file / pilih status atau tanggal
    History -> History: Filter data yang sudah dimuat
    History --> User: Menampilkan hasil filter\n(4 item per halaman)
  end

  alt Membuka hasil analisis
    User -> History: Pilih SEE RESULT / DETAIL LOG
    History -> History: Buka /analysis/{id}
  else Menghapus riwayat
    User -> History: Pilih Delete
    History --> User: Meminta konfirmasi
    User -> History: Konfirmasi penghapusan
    History -> API: DELETE /api/history/{id}\n(access token)
    API -> Auth: Verifikasi token
    Auth --> API: User terautentikasi
    API -> Database: Verifikasi kepemilikan dan hapus record
    Database --> API: Record dihapus
    opt Jika ada file terkait
      API -> Storage: Hapus file terkait
      Storage --> API: Hasil penghapusan file
    end
    API --> History: Respons berhasil
    History --> User: Menghapus item dari daftar
  end
end

note over History,API
  Filter dilakukan di frontend.
  Jika request gagal, halaman menampilkan pesan error.
end note

note over Database,Storage
  Record database dihapus lebih dahulu.
  Kegagalan menghapus file Storage tidak membatalkan
  keberhasilan penghapusan riwayat.
end note

@enduml
